er with games like ratchet and clank  rift apart  showing it off full force this means  less scrolling through reddit to pass  time and more immersion in games  now long loading screens are lost to  nostalgia a thing to tell your children  about  until they stop listening to you and  force you to go back to bed  number three vertical horizontal stand  and removable panels  love it or hate it the ps5 certainly  stands out and despite its obtuse design  it can in fact stand tall or lay  horizontally thanks to its nifty stand  also the panels are removable paving the  way to some sweet customized panels  to come and even cooler there's also a  dust catcher vent  that you can use to vacuum away the dust  pretty sweet  number two game boost and backwards  compatibility worry not  your favorite playstation games of  yesteryear aren't being left behind  not only will 99 of ps4 games work on  the ps5  that figure courtesy of playstation ceo  jim ryan  but the newest member of the playstation  family is also giving select ps4  and psvr games a bit of a facelift with  fast and smooth frame rates  if you're subscribed to ps plus you get  some of those classic ps4 games for free  as a part of your subscription the  selection of freebie games includes  bloodborne god of war and uncharted 4.  play bloodborne number one cooling  any ps4 owner should know a little too  well  the beautiful screaming sound of the  console's fan going in overdrive  for the ps5 however not only does it  come with a chunk of a fan meant for  drawing in lots of air  it also has a super sleek dope copper  cooling system  and even liquid metal for long-term  cooling performance  putting the cool and this being a cool  feature for the  cool ps5 okay yeah and there you have it  some of the coolest ps5 features thanks  for watching for more playstation past  present and future keep your eyes on  gamespot and while you're at it  check out the show generation next it's  the show about  next generation consoles 